name walk-secret-c03-reload
title Crossroads_03's secret wall after Continue from a save that holds it broken: the Knight walks left through where it stood, no hits, no breaks
max_ticks 6000
sync poll
# Replaces the open-loop tape secret-c03-reload (4 hand-inserted neutral polls, docs/REPIN-LOG.md). The old pin was an end X after 90
# polls of Left (634672 on every run since the pad-fix pin); this one walks to a place, so it does not move when gameplay starts a poll earlier.
card secret-c03-reload.mcd
wait 300
press cross
wait 40
press cross
wait until HK_GAME_MODE == 1 timeout 1500
wait until HK_WALK_READY == 1 timeout 900
check continued HK_SAVE_LOADED == 1 ; HK_REGION_ID == 159 ; HK_SECRET_HITS == 0 ; HK_SECRET_BREAKS == 0 ; HK_DEATHS == 0 ; HK_CHEATS == 0
hold left until x le 9.7 timeout 900
check through x le 9.7 ; HK_REGION_ID == 159 ; HK_SECRET_HITS == 0 ; HK_SECRET_BREAKS == 0 ; HK_DEATHS == 0 ; HK_CHEATS == 0
